<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="color:#16a34a">Verify your email address</h2>
      <p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
      <p>Click the button below to confirm your email address for the beachvolleyballproject API.</p>

      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
             style="margin:24px 0; border-radius:4px; background-color:#16a34a; text-align:center">
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:12px">
            <a href="<%= @verify_url %>"
               style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:500; border-radius:4px">
              Verify email address
            </a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p>This link expires in <%= @expires_in.humanize %> and can only be used once.</p>
      <p>If the button above does not work, copy and paste the link below into your browser:</p>
      <p style="word-break:break-all; color:#555; font-size:12px"><%= @verify_url %></p>
      <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #eee; margin:24px 0">

      <p>If you did not register for this app, you may safely ignore this email. No action is needed.</p>
      <p>— Beach Volleyball Project Team</p>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>